doctype html
html(lang="en")
  head
    meta(charset="UTF-8")
    meta(name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0")
    title BlockPlanner Report Delivery
    style.
      body {
        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
        background-color: #f4f4f4;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 20px;
      }

      .container {
        max-width: 640px;
        margin: auto;
        background-color: #ffffff;
        padding: 28px;
        border-radius: 6px;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
      }

      h2 {
        margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        color: #1a5276;
      }

      p, li {
        font-size: 16px;
        line-height: 1.6;
        color: #333333;
      }

      .meta {
        background-color: #f9f9f9;
        padding: 12px 14px;
        border: 1px solid #dddddd;
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin: 16px 0 18px 0;
      }

      .footer {
        margin-top: 22px;
        font-size: 13px;
        color: #888888;
        text-align: center;
      }
  body
    .container
      h2 Your BlockPlanner Site Assessment Report

      p Hi #{clientName},

      p Thanks for using BlockPlanner. Please find your Site Assessment Report attached.
      if address
        .meta
          p
            strong Address:
            |  #{address}
          if reportId
            p
              strong Report ID:
              |  #{reportId}

      p If you'd like to proceed further, reply to this email and we'll help you understand the best pathway forward.

      p A Detailed Feasibility Review can confirm the things we can't verify from public mapping, including:
      ul
        li Tree status and protection zones
        li Services capacity (sewer, stormwater, electrical)
        li Access and parking compliance
        li Solar access and overshadowing constraints

      p Best regards,
      p The LotLogic Team

      .footer
        p This is an automated message. Please reply to this email if you have questions.
